  "bio": "Chaini, a distinguished tattoo studio in Madrid, Spain, brings the rich tradition of 1977 tattoo artistry alive with its expertise in Traditional and Japanese styles. The parlour embraces a classic yet intimate environment, reflecting the artistic charm of historic Madrid.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Madrid, Community Of Madrid, Spain"
